\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Held-out public TE--cCRE evaluation after selection was persisted. (a) Test excess Brier risk reveals family-specific rank reversals; blue marks C03. (b) The five primary selectors coincide over 576 fixed mixtures within $\rho \leq .25$. (c) C03 is selected throughout the radius path, while the 95\% set remains large. (d) Selection raw/effective roots are 567/546 (ERVL), 521/281 (L1), 593/591 (L2), and 503/501 (MIR); the largest held-out root weight is 4.22\%.}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:te}{{3}{8}{Held-out public TE--cCRE evaluation after selection was persisted. (a) Test excess Brier risk reveals family-specific rank reversals; blue marks C03. (b) The five primary selectors coincide over 576 fixed mixtures within $\rho \leq .25$. (c) C03 is selected throughout the radius path, while the 95\% set remains large. (d) Selection raw/effective roots are 567/546 (ERVL), 521/281 (L1), 593/591 (L2), and 503/501 (MIR); the largest held-out root weight is 4.22\%}{figure.3}{}}
